{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105767","id":2482346090,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6T9Zhq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105767","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105767.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105767.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105767","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105767/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105767/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105767/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/af7610576ad058e3cbefd45ea6bc47f491d2b29e","number":105767,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize static allocations by removing unused `Memory::alloc_count`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The int `Memory::alloc_count` is being incremented and decremented in `Memory`, but never used.\r\nAs an atomic, it is quite slow. It should be removed.\r\n\r\nThis bottleneck was found by @Nazarwadim in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97016#issuecomment-2356447368.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\nI benchmarked a ~15% improvement for `Memory::alloc_static`:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < 20000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\tMemory::alloc_static(16);\r\n\t}\r\n\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis printed:\r\n- `306ms` on master\r\n- `263ms` on this PR","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels"